4	// request/event-loop thread. It is deliberately written in strip-only
5	// TypeScript — type annotations and interfaces only, no enums, namespaces,
6	// decorators or parameter properties — so Node 22.23.1 can execute it directly
7	// with `execArgv: []`. It must never import ./index.ts, or the main-thread
8	// crypto surface would be pulled into the worker and hash-wasm would become
9	// reachable from the request path again.
